 ],
 "tone": "Cautious on near-term demand headwinds and memory inflation, but confident on long-term growth and backward integration.",
 "pushback": [
  {
   "topic": "Vivo JV Approval",
   "gist": "Analysts repeatedly questioned the status and timeline of the pending Vivo joint venture approval.",
   "page": 8
  },
  {
   "topic": "Mobile Volume Growth",
   "gist": "Concerned whether flat volume guidance indicates market share loss or weaker industry demand below $200.",
   "page": 12
  },
  {
   "topic": "PLI Expiry Impact",
   "gist": "Asked about margin hits once the mobile PLI scheme ends and how much offset will come from backward integration.",
